on't include check-repository-artifacts. But the AGENTS/design says \"干净候选...凭据扫描\". Hmm.\n\nActually, let me reconsider — maybe I should keep parity with G01/O01 precedent and NOT try to fix a pre-existing gate. The task's acceptance criteria are: lifecycleStatus present, archive-not-delete, docs resolvable (validate-policy-docs + error-governance), AGENTS <=400, single doc-gardening rule, and clean-candidate targeted tests + harness validate/dry-run + credential scan + SHA256SUMS.\n\nNone of these require check-repository-artifacts. And it's already failing at base. So I should not attempt to fix it (out of scope, and it's a workspace-state artifact).\n\nBut hold on — should I register G02's evidence files in retainedFiles to keep the gate no-worse? The gate already fails; adding one more spec with an unregistered doc doesn't change pass→fail. Precedent (G01..S07) shows packets didn't register. But O01 DID register. Inconsistent.\n\nLet me verify the base state definitively: I can check if the base snapshot's check-repository-artifacts fails by looking at whether those evidence files are listed in repository-artifacts.json. I already know they're not (only 10 entries). And isLocalArtifact(docs/...unregistered) = true. So yes, base gate fails.\n\nActually — wait. Let me double-check isLocalArtifact more carefully:\n\n```\nreturn policy.localOnlyFiles.includes(path)\n    || policy.retiredTests.includes(path)\n    || policy.localOnlyDirectories.some(...)\n    || (policy.reviewedDirectories?.some((directory) => path.startsWith(`${directory}/`))\n      && !policy.retainedFiles?.includes(path)) === true;\n```\n\ndocs is a reviewedDirectory. g01-error-recovery-next-action.md starts with \"docs/\" and is not retained → isLocalArtifact = true. Yes, base fails.\n\nHmm, but that would mean the repo's CI is red at base for a LOT of specs. That seems odd for a \"pristine baseline\" trial. Let me reconsider: maybe those g01..s07 docs ARE in retainedFiles but my earlier grep only matched 10 because I searched 'harness-gap-closure' and got 10. Let me re-grep all retainedFiles for these specific evidence docs.\n\nLet me just directly test with node."}}
